id: pm-466m0j
title: "GH-1202: Classify abandoned merge receipts without losing durable provenance"
description: Reproduce receipt lifecycle after an aborted rebase and distinguish an abandoned candidate from a merge requiring review. Current source and Merge Safety documentation intentionally track privacy-safe durable sidecars; raw free-form retained/discarded values are clone-local under .git. Durable receipts retain hashes and only allowlisted low-cardinality scalar previews. The report has not demonstrated a secret leak. A blanket gitignore or evidence deletion would break cross-clone provenance and is not an accepted remedy.
