author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "An actual conflicting rebase followed by abort has deterministic receipt classification and a supported recovery path; Recovery preserves immutable evidence and cannot dismiss an applied merge merely because a later snapshot differs; Fresh-clone tests prove tracked sidecars never contain arbitrary descriptions, acceptance text, or custom status values; CLI guidance clearly distinguishes clone-local raw receipts from intentionally tracked durable sidecars"
value: Reduce recovery ambiguity and preserve trustworthy project context for agents
outcome: A reproducible SDK contract with actionable CLI recovery and regression evidence
why_now: New user report GH-1202 during PR #1204 final integration
